        "committer": {
          "name": "Di Wang",
          "email": "diwa@nvidia.com",
          "date": "2026-11-03 23:26:35.000000000",
          "tz": -480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21061 mgs: allow adding MDTs to pools",
        "message": "LU-21061 mgs: allow adding MDTs to pools\n\nlctl pool_add and the MGS accept only OST names, so a pool cannot\nlimit which MDTs a directory tree uses.\n\nAccept MDT names in check_and_complete_ostname() and\nmgs_pool_check_ostname(), checking them against the MDT index map.\nRefuse MDT0000 with -EPERM: it holds the root and the filesystem-wide\nservices, so it is never part of a pool.  Print \"MDT\" instead of \"OST\"\nin the lctl messages for MDT members.\n\nClients keep ignoring MDT members until they learn about them.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial mdscount=2 mdtcount=4 testlist=ost-pools\nSigned-off-by: Di Wang <diwa@nvidia.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 ltvm\nChange-Id: I45a544461d3ed7e2b273c16e8f871785082cce20\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
